    <region left="0" top="702" width="511" height="53" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>Approach 1 <br />Design values from Set C and from Set B are applied in separate calculations to the <br />geotechnical actions and to all other actions from the structure or on the structure. </p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
