    <region left="0" top="1008" width="557" height="53" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>Note: For all the above-listed combinations, two possibilities must be considered: either that <br />the surcharge concerns only the part of embankment beyond the foundation footing <br />(Fig. 2.10a), or that it acts on the whole surface of the embankment (Fig. 2.10b). </p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="1062" width="569" height="38" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>For brevity, only cases in relation with case b), i.e. with surcharge acting on the whole surface <br />of embankment, are given below. </p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
